                        <div class="entry-header">
    	                    
                            <h1 class="jeg_post_title">Wan’da kadın atölyesi</h1>

                                                            <h2 class="jeg_post_subtitle">DBP Kadın Meclisi, “Kadın Kurtuluş Atölyeleri” kapsamında Wan’da kadınlarla bir araya gelerek, süreçteki rolleri üzerine tartıştı.</h2>
                            
                            <div class="jeg_meta_container"><div class="jeg_post_meta jeg_post_meta_1">

	<div class="meta_left">
		
					<div class="jeg_meta_date">
				<a href="https://politikahaber.com/wanda-kadin-atolyesi/">13 Ağustos 2025</a>
			</div>
		
		
			</div>

	<div class="meta_right">
					</div>
</div>
</div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="jeg_featured featured_image"><a href="https://politikahaber.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/resized_image-310.jpg"><div class="thumbnail-container animate-lazy" style="padding-bottom:50%"><img width="750" height="375" src="https://politikahaber.com/wp-content/themes/jnews/assets/img/jeg-empty.png" class="attachment-jnews-750x375 size-jnews-750x375 lazyload wp-post-image" alt="Wan’da kadın atölyesi" title="Wan’da kadın atölyesi" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" sizes="(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px" data-src="https://politikahaber.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/resized_image-310.jpg" data-srcset="https://politikahaber.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/resized_image-310.jpg 750w, https://politikahaber.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/resized_image-310-300x150.jpg 300w, https://politikahaber.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/resized_image-310-360x180.jpg 360w" data-sizes="auto" data-expand="700" /></div></a></div>
