<div class="jeg_ad jnews_mobile_sticky_ads "></div><script type='application/ld+json'>{"@context":"http:\/\/schema.org","@type":"article","mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https:\/\/politikahaber.com\/wanda-kadin-atolyesi\/"},"dateCreated":"2025-08-13 18:03:33","datePublished":"2025-08-13 18:03:33","dateModified":"2025-08-13 15:03:33","url":"https:\/\/politikahaber.com\/wanda-kadin-atolyesi\/","headline":"Wan\u2019da kad\u0131n at\u00f6lyesi","name":"Wan\u2019da kad\u0131n at\u00f6lyesi","articleBody":"Demokratik B\u00f6lgeler Partisi (DBP) Kad\u0131n Meclisi, Wan\u2019da \u201cKad\u0131n Kurtulu\u015f \u0130deolojisi\u201d at\u00f6lyesi ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirdi. Artem\u00eat (Edremit) il\u00e7esine ba\u011fl\u0131 \u015eehit F\u0131rat Mahallesi\u2019nde yap\u0131lan at\u00f6lyeye, DBP Wan \u0130l E\u015fba\u015fkan\u0131 G\u00f6n\u00fcl Uzunay, DBP Kad\u0131n Meclisi S\u00f6zc\u00fcs\u00fc Berivan Bah\u00e7eci, DBP PM \u00fcyesi Hebun Aslan ve \u00e7ok say\u0131da kad\u0131n kat\u0131ld\u0131.\r\n\r\nAt\u00f6lyede konu\u015fan Berivan Bah\u00e7eci, \u201cK\u00fcrt Halk Lideri Abdullah \u00d6calan\u2019\u0131n ba\u015flatt\u0131\u011f\u0131 \u2018demokratik toplum\u2019 s\u00fcrecinde kad\u0131nlar\u0131n rol\u00fc \u00e7ok \u00f6nemli. Kad\u0131n kurtulu\u015f ideolojisi diyoruz. Ne i\u00e7in bunu s\u00f6yl\u00fcyoruz? Neden kurtulmak istiyoruz? Bunlar\u0131 sizlerle kar\u015f\u0131l\u0131kl\u0131 konu\u015fmak i\u00e7in bir araya geldik. Kad\u0131n tarihine bakt\u0131\u011f\u0131m\u0131zda do\u011fas\u0131nda kendi kendini y\u00f6netme hakk\u0131na sahipti. Ama \u015fimdi kad\u0131n daha fazla k\u00f6lelik bak\u0131\u015f a\u00e7\u0131s\u0131yla iradesi yok say\u0131l\u0131yor. Bu da erke\u011fin zihniyetinden kaynaklan\u0131yor. K\u00fcrt Halk \u00d6nderi Abdullah \u00d6calan\u2019\u0131n dedi\u011fi gibi kad\u0131n \u00f6zg\u00fcrle\u015fmeden toplum \u00f6zg\u00fcrle\u015fmez. Yani bu demek oluyor ki toplum ancak kad\u0131nla \u00f6zg\u00fcrle\u015fir \u201c dedi.\r\n\r\nArd\u0131ndan at\u00f6lyede soru cevap b\u00f6l\u00fcm\u00fc ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirildi. At\u00f6lye, \u201cJin, jiyan, azad\u00ee\u201d slogan\u0131yla sona erdi.\r\n\r\n<strong>MA<\/strong>","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Politika Haber","url":"https:\/\/politikahaber.com\/author\/admin_ze\/"},"articleSection":["G\u00fcndem"],"image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/politikahaber.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/resized_image-310.jpg","width":750,"height":375},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"","url":"https:\/\/politikahaber.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":""},"sameAs":["https:\/\/facebook.com\/politikamedya","https:\/\/twitter.com\/politikamedya","https:\/\/instagram.com\/politikamedya","https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/channel\/UCkAyrrk1uEX2rVfw8PjkLZA"]}}</script>
